flowchart LR

%% ===== Actors =====
User([Utilisateur])
Doctor([Médecin])
System([Système IA])

%% ===== User Use Cases =====
User --> UC1[Créer un compte]
User --> UC2[Se connecter]
User --> UC3[Consulter données physiologiques]
User --> UC4[Gérer contacts d'urgence]
User --> UC5[Recevoir alertes]

%% ===== Core System =====
UC6[Enregistrer données physiologiques]
UC7[Analyser données]
UC8[Prédire crise d'asthme]
UC9[Envoyer alerte]

%% ===== Flow =====
User --> UC6
UC6 --> System
System --> UC7
UC7 --> UC8
UC8 --> UC9
UC9 --> User

%% ===== Emergency =====
UC9 --> UC10[Notifier contacts d'urgence]
User --> UC10
